  "description": "Zero-code CRUD API generation for ASP.NET Core.\n      Decorate your model classes with [ApiImplementer] and get full GET / POST / PUT / DELETE\n      REST endpoints registered automatically — no controllers required.\n      Comes with a built-in in-memory store for quick prototyping and an\n      EFCoreAutoApiStore<T, TContext> for production use with any DbContext.",
